OL,3,GNEWSAGiant flower 'carpet' to be
OL,4,Acreated in city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 300,000 dahlias will be
OL,7,Fhand-placed on the pavement outside
OL,8,FBradford City Hall to create a flower
OL,9,F"carpet".
OL,11,FAbout 40 volunteers will help to make
OL,12,Fthe 95ft (29m) hexagonal-shaped public
OL,13,Fartwork in Centenary Square, which will
OL,14,Fbe officially opened later.
OL,16,FLocal artist Shiraaz Ali used the
OL,17,Fcity's textile heritage and
OL,18,Fmulticultural population as the
OL,19,Finspiration for his design.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
